          "id": "code-ml-21-1-ch21_1_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Lloyd & D^2 Seeding K-Means++ (30-Trial Local Minima & Monotonicity)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "21_1_kmeans_pp_lloyd_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\n\ndef pairwise_sq_dists(X: np.ndarray, C: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"Hitung matriks jarak Euclidean kuadrat ||x_i - c_k||^2 secara vektorisasi.\"\"\"\n    x_norm = np.sum(X ** 2, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    c_norm = np.sum(C ** 2, axis=1, keepdims=True).T\n    return np.maximum(x_norm + c_norm - 2.0 * (X @ C.T), 0.0)\n\ndef init_kmeans_pp(X: np.ndarray, k: int, rng: np.random.Generator) -> np.ndarray:\n    \"\"\"Inisialisasi D^2 seeding K-Means++ (Arthur & Vassilvitskii, 2007).\"\"\"\n    n = X.shape[0]\n    centers = np.empty((k, X.shape[1]), dtype=float)\n    first_idx = int(rng.integers(0, n))\n    centers[0] = X[first_idx]\n    min_d2 = np.sum((X - centers[0]) ** 2, axis=1)\n    for m in range(1, k):\n        total = float(np.sum(min_d2))\n        probs = min_d2 / total if total > 0.0 else np.full(n, 1.0 / n)\n        next_idx = int(rng.choice(n, p=probs))\n        centers[m] = X[next_idx]\n        new_d2 = np.sum((X - centers[m]) ** 2, axis=1)\n        min_d2 = np.minimum(min_d2, new_d2)\n    return centers\n\ndef run_lloyd(X: np.ndarray, k: int, init_mode: str, seed: int, max_iter: int = 80):\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    if init_mode == \"kmeans++\":\n        centers = init_kmeans_pp(X, k, rng)\n    else:\n        centers = X[rng.choice(X.shape[0], size=k, replace=False)].copy()\n\n    history = []\n    prev_labels = None\n    for it in range(1, max_iter + 1):\n        d2 = pairwise_sq_dists(X, centers)\n        labels = np.argmin(d2, axis=1)\n        wcss = float(np.sum(d2[np.arange(X.shape[0]), labels]))\n        history.append(wcss)\n        if prev_labels is not None and np.array_equal(labels, prev_labels):\n            break\n        prev_labels = labels\n        for c_id in range(k):\n            mask = labels == c_id\n            if np.any(mask):\n                centers[c_id] = X[mask].mean(axis=0)\n            else:\n                # Re-seed klaster kosong ke titik dengan residual kuadrat terbesar\n                far_idx = int(np.argmax(d2[np.arange(X.shape[0]), labels]))\n                centers[c_id] = X[far_idx]\n\n    monotone_ok = all(history[i] <= history[i - 1] + 1e-9 for i in range(1, len(history)))\n    return centers, labels, history, monotone_ok\n\n# Bangun 6 klaster sferis terpisah jauh (kasus klasik yang menjebak random seeding!)\nrng_data = np.random.default_rng(211)\ntrue_centers = np.array([\n    [0.0, 0.0], [18.0, 0.0], [36.0, 0.0],\n    [0.0, 18.0], [18.0, 18.0], [36.0, 18.0],\n])\nX = np.vstack([rng_data.normal(loc=mu, scale=0.85, size=(75, 2)) for mu in true_centers])\n\n# Hitung WCSS optimum referensi berdasarkan klaster ground-truth\ny_true = np.repeat(np.arange(6), 75)\nopt_centers = np.vstack([X[y_true == c].mean(axis=0) for c in range(6)])\nphi_opt = float(np.sum((X - opt_centers[y_true]) ** 2))\n\nrand_wcss, pp_wcss, rand_iters, pp_iters = [], [], [], []\nrand_bad_traps, pp_bad_traps = 0, 0\nall_monotone = True\n\nfor trial in range(30):\n    _, _, h_r, mono_r = run_lloyd(X, k=6, init_mode=\"random\", seed=100 + trial)\n    _, _, h_p, mono_p = run_lloyd(X, k=6, init_mode=\"kmeans++\", seed=100 + trial)\n    all_monotone = all_monotone and mono_r and mono_p\n    rand_wcss.append(h_r[-1])\n    pp_wcss.append(h_p[-1])\n    rand_iters.append(len(h_r))\n    pp_iters.append(len(h_p))\n    if h_r[-1] > 1.25 * phi_opt:\n        rand_bad_traps += 1\n    if h_p[-1] > 1.25 * phi_opt:\n        pp_bad_traps += 1\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Benchmark 30 Trial: Random Seeding vs K-Means++ (6 Klaster Terpisah Jauh) ===\")\nprint(f\"WCSS Optimum Referensi (phi_OPT)        = {phi_opt:10.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Verifikasi Konvergensi Monoton 60 Run   = {all_monotone}\")\nprint(f\"Random Seeding  | Median WCSS={np.median(rand_wcss):9.2f} | Max={np.max(rand_wcss):10.2f} | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)={rand_bad_traps:2d}/30 | Mean Iter={np.mean(rand_iters):.1f}\")\nprint(f\"K-Means++ (D^2) | Median WCSS={np.median(pp_wcss):9.2f} | Max={np.max(pp_wcss):10.2f} | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)={pp_bad_traps:2d}/30 | Mean Iter={np.mean(pp_iters):.1f}\")\n\n# Verifikasi identik: WCSS klaster == rata-rata setengah jarak pasangan kuadrat dalam klaster\nc0_pts = X[y_true == 0]\nmu0 = c0_pts.mean(axis=0)\nlhs_wcss = float(np.sum((c0_pts - mu0) ** 2))\nrhs_pair = float(np.sum(pairwise_sq_dists(c0_pts, c0_pts)) / (2.0 * len(c0_pts)))\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2. Verifikasi Identitas Varians Pasangan dalam Klaster 0 ===\")\nprint(f\"Sum ||x_i - mu_0||^2 = {lhs_wcss:.6f} | (1/(2|C_0|)) Sum ||x_i - x_j||^2 = {rhs_pair:.6f} | |Gap| = {abs(lhs_wcss - rhs_pair):.2e}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Benchmark 30 Trial: Random Seeding vs K-Means++ (6 Klaster Terpisah Jauh) ===\nWCSS Optimum Referensi (phi_OPT)        =     627.65\nVerifikasi Konvergensi Monoton 60 Run   = True\nRandom Seeding  | Median WCSS= 12587.30 | Max=  25503.98 | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)=18/30 | Mean Iter=6.1\nK-Means++ (D^2) | Median WCSS=   627.65 | Max=    627.65 | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)= 0/30 | Mean Iter=2.0\n\n=== 2. Verifikasi Identitas Varians Pasangan dalam Klaster 0 ===\nSum ||x_i - mu_0||^2 = 108.481285 | (1/(2|C_0|)) Sum ||x_i - x_j||^2 = 108.481285 | |Gap| = 1.42e-14",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Benchmark 30 Trial: Random Seeding vs K-Means++ (6 Klaster Terpisah Jauh) ===\nWCSS Optimum Referensi (phi_OPT)        =     627.65\nVerifikasi Konvergensi Monoton 60 Run   = True\nRandom Seeding  | Median WCSS= 12587.30 | Max=  25503.98 | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)=18/30 | Mean Iter=6.1\nK-Means++ (D^2) | Median WCSS=   627.65 | Max=    627.65 | Jebakan Lokal (>1.25*OPT)= 0/30 | Mean Iter=2.0\n\n=== 2. Verifikasi Identitas Varians Pasangan dalam Klaster 0 ===\nSum ||x_i - mu_0||^2 = 108.481285 | (1/(2|C_0|)) Sum ||x_i - x_j||^2 = 108.481285 | |Gap| = 1.42e-14",
