          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score, normalized_mutual_info_score\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import Pipeline\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(212)\n\n# Simulasi 600 nasabah perbankan dari 4 persona bisnis nyata:\n# Fitur 0: Saldo Tabungan (Rupiah: 5 juta s.d. 180 juta) -> rentang skala ~10^8\n# Fitur 1: Usia Nasabah (22 - 64 tahun)\n# Fitur 2: Rasio Utilisasi Limit Kredit (0.05 - 0.95)\n# Fitur 3: Frekuensi Transaksi Digital / Bulan (2 - 65)\nspecs = [\n    # (saldo_mean, saldo_std, usia_m, usia_s, util_m, util_s, freq_m, freq_s)\n    (42_000_000, 14_000_000, 26.0, 3.0, 0.78, 0.08, 48.0, 6.0),  # Young Active Revolving\n    (48_000_000, 14_000_000, 52.0, 4.0, 0.16, 0.06,  9.0, 3.0),  # Conservative Mature Saver\n    (118_000_000, 18_000_000, 34.0, 3.5, 0.22, 0.07, 54.0, 6.0), # Affluent Digital Transactor\n    (112_000_000, 18_000_000, 56.0, 4.0, 0.72, 0.09, 14.0, 4.0), # Senior High-Balance Credit User\n]\nblocks = []\nfor s_m, s_s, u_m, u_s, r_m, r_s, f_m, f_s in specs:\n    n_c = 150\n    blk = np.column_stack([\n        rng.normal(s_m, s_s, n_c),\n        rng.normal(u_m, u_s, n_c),\n        np.clip(rng.normal(r_m, r_s, n_c), 0.02, 0.99),\n        np.clip(rng.normal(f_m, f_s, n_c), 1.0, 90.0),\n    ])\n    blocks.append(blk)\n\nX_bank = np.vstack(blocks)\ny_true = np.repeat(np.arange(4), 150)\n\n# 1) ANTI-PATTERN: K-Means langsung tanpa StandardScaler & init=\"random\", n_init=1\nkm_raw = KMeans(n_clusters=4, init=\"random\", n_init=1, random_state=7).fit(X_bank)\nari_raw = adjusted_rand_score(y_true, km_raw.labels_)\nnmi_raw = normalized_mutual_info_score(y_true, km_raw.labels_)\n\n# 2) PARTIAL FIX: StandardScaler + init=\"random\", n_init=1\npipe_rand = Pipeline([\n    (\"scaler\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"km\", KMeans(n_clusters=4, init=\"random\", n_init=1, random_state=7)),\n]).fit(X_bank)\nari_rand = adjusted_rand_score(y_true, pipe_rand.named_steps[\"km\"].labels_)\nnmi_rand = normalized_mutual_info_score(y_true, pipe_rand.named_steps[\"km\"].labels_)\n\n# 3) PRODUCTION-SAFE: Pipeline(StandardScaler + KMeans(init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10))\npipe_safe = Pipeline([\n    (\"scaler\", StandardScaler()),\n    (\"km\", KMeans(n_clusters=4, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10, random_state=42)),\n]).fit(X_bank)\nari_safe = adjusted_rand_score(y_true, pipe_safe.named_steps[\"km\"].labels_)\nnmi_safe = normalized_mutual_info_score(y_true, pipe_safe.named_steps[\"km\"].labels_)\n\n# Cek kontribusi varians mentah fitur Rupiah terhadap total varians sebelum scaling\nraw_vars = np.var(X_bank, axis=0)\nrupiah_var_share = 100.0 * raw_vars[0] / np.sum(raw_vars)\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Dominasi Skala Rupiah vs Pipeline(StandardScaler + K-Means++) ===\")\nprint(f\"Pangsa Varians Mentah Fitur Saldo (IDR)        = {rupiah_var_share:.8f}% (fitur lain praktis lenyap!)\")\nprint(f\"1. Anti-Pattern (Raw + init='random', n=1)     | ARI = {ari_raw:.4f} | NMI = {nmi_raw:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"2. StandardScaler + init='random', n_init=1    | ARI = {ari_rand:.4f} | NMI = {nmi_rand:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"3. Production Pipeline (Scaler + k-means++ x10)| ARI = {ari_safe:.4f} | NMI = {nmi_safe:.4f}\")\n\n# Audit profil centroid hasil anti-pattern vs production-safe\nprint(\"\\nRentang Usia Rata-Rata Antar-Klaster (Sejati: 26, 34, 52, 56 thn):\")\nraw_ages = sorted([float(X_bank[km_raw.labels_ == c, 1].mean()) for c in range(4)])\nsafe_ages = sorted([float(X_bank[pipe_safe.named_steps['km'].labels_ == c, 1].mean()) for c in range(4)])\nprint(f\"  Anti-Pattern (Raw IDR) : {[round(a, 1) for a in raw_ages]}  <-- Tercampur jadi ~40 thn semua!\")\nprint(f\"  Production-Safe Pipe   : {[round(a, 1) for a in safe_ages]}  <-- Persona usia pulih akurat!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Dominasi Skala Rupiah vs Pipeline(StandardScaler + K-Means++) ===\nPangsa Varians Mentah Fitur Saldo (IDR)        = 100.00000000% (fitur lain praktis lenyap!)\n1. Anti-Pattern (Raw + init='random', n=1)     | ARI = 0.3298 | NMI = 0.4572\n2. StandardScaler + init='random', n_init=1    | ARI = 1.0000 | NMI = 1.0000\n3. Production Pipeline (Scaler + k-means++ x10)| ARI = 1.0000 | NMI = 1.0000\n\nRentang Usia Rata-Rata Antar-Klaster (Sejati: 26, 34, 52, 56 thn):\n  Anti-Pattern (Raw IDR) : [36.5, 43.0, 43.2, 46.1]  <-- Tercampur jadi ~40 thn semua!\n  Production-Safe Pipe   : [26.2, 33.9, 52.3, 56.0]  <-- Persona usia pulih akurat!",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Dominasi Skala Rupiah vs Pipeline(StandardScaler + K-Means++) ===\nPangsa Varians Mentah Fitur Saldo (IDR)        = 100.00000000% (fitur lain praktis lenyap!)\n1. Anti-Pattern (Raw + init='random', n=1)     | ARI = 0.3298 | NMI = 0.4572\n2. StandardScaler + init='random', n_init=1    | ARI = 1.0000 | NMI = 1.0000\n3. Production Pipeline (Scaler + k-means++ x10)| ARI = 1.0000 | NMI = 1.0000\n\nRentang Usia Rata-Rata Antar-Klaster (Sejati: 26, 34, 52, 56 thn):\n  Anti-Pattern (Raw IDR) : [36.5, 43.0, 43.2, 46.1]  <-- Tercampur jadi ~40 thn semua!\n  Production-Safe Pipe   : [26.2, 33.9, 52.3, 56.0]  <-- Persona usia pulih akurat!",
          "explanation": "Membandingkan K-Means mentah (init='random', n_init=1, tanpa scaling) melawan Pipeline([StandardScaler(), KMeans(init='k-means++', n_init=10)]) pada 600 profil nasabah bank berunit campuran Saldo IDR (10^8) vs Usia, Utilisasi, dan Frekuensi.",
