          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_moons\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(213)\n\n# Skenario A: Klaster Sferis Isotropik Seimbang (Baseline Ideal K-Means)\nX_iso = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([-2.2, 0.0], 0.65, size=(180, 2)),\n    rng.normal([ 2.2, 0.0], 0.65, size=(180, 2)),\n    rng.normal([ 0.0, 3.2], 0.65, size=(180, 2)),\n])\ny_iso = np.repeat([0, 1, 2], 180)\n\n# Skenario B: Klaster Anisotropik Memanjang (Elips miring sejajar, kovarians non-sferis!)\nT_stretch = np.array([[2.6, 1.9], [0.4, 0.25]])\nX_aniso = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 1.0, size=(180, 2)) @ T_stretch + np.array([0.0, 0.0]),\n    rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 1.0, size=(180, 2)) @ T_stretch + np.array([0.0, 2.2]),\n    rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 1.0, size=(180, 2)) @ T_stretch + np.array([0.0, 4.4]),\n])\ny_aniso = np.repeat([0, 1, 2], 180)\n\n# Skenario C: Varians & Ukuran Timpang Ekstrem (1 klaster kecil padat vs 1 klaster besar lebar)\nX_unequal = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([-2.8, 0.0], 0.25, size=(120, 2)),  # padat kecil\n    rng.normal([ 1.8, 0.0], 2.40, size=(360, 2)),  # lebar & besar\n])\ny_unequal = np.concatenate([np.zeros(120, dtype=int), np.ones(360, dtype=int)])\n\n# Skenario D: Geometri Non-Konveks (Dua Bulan Sabit Saling Mengunci)\nX_moons, y_moons = make_moons(n_samples=360, noise=0.06, random_state=42)\n\nscenarios = [\n    (\"A. Isotropik Sferis (Ideal Voronoi)\", X_iso, y_iso, 3),\n    (\"B. Anisotropik Memanjang (Elips Sejajar)\", X_aniso, y_aniso, 3),\n    (\"C. Varians & Ukuran Timpang (0.25 vs 2.4)\", X_unequal, y_unequal, 2),\n    (\"D. Non-Konveks (Dua Bulan Sabit)\", X_moons, y_moons, 2),\n]\n\nprint(\"=== Audit Kegagalan Geometri Asumsi Sferis / Voronoi pada K-Means++ ===\")\nprint(\"Skenario Geometri                         |  K |  ARI   | Rasio Ukuran Prediksi vs Sejati\")\nprint(\"-\" * 88)\nfor name, X_s, y_s, k in scenarios:\n    Xs = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_s)\n    pred = KMeans(n_clusters=k, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(Xs)\n    ari = adjusted_rand_score(y_s, pred)\n    true_cnts = sorted(np.bincount(y_s).tolist())\n    pred_cnts = sorted(np.bincount(pred).tolist())\n    print(f\"{name:41s} | {k:2d} | {ari:6.4f} | pred={pred_cnts} vs true={true_cnts}\")\n\n# Audit tambahan pada Skenario C: seberapa banyak anggota klaster besar dicaplok oleh centroid klaster kecil?\nXs_u = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_unequal)\npred_u = KMeans(n_clusters=2, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(Xs_u)\nsmall_cluster_label = int(np.bincount(pred_u[:120]).argmax())\nmisassigned_big_into_small = int(np.sum(pred_u[120:] == small_cluster_label))\nprint(f\"\\n[Diagnosis Skenario C] Akibat bisektor Voronoi berada tepat di tengah dua centroid,\")\nprint(f\"sebanyak {misassigned_big_into_small}/360 ({100.0*misassigned_big_into_small/360:.1f}%) anggota klaster lebar salah dicaplok ke klaster kecil!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Audit Kegagalan Geometri Asumsi Sferis / Voronoi pada K-Means++ ===\nSkenario Geometri                         |  K |  ARI   | Rasio Ukuran Prediksi vs Sejati\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA. Isotropik Sferis (Ideal Voronoi)       |  3 | 1.0000 | pred=[180, 180, 180] vs true=[180, 180, 180]\nB. Anisotropik Memanjang (Elips Sejajar)  |  3 | 0.0632 | pred=[133, 174, 233] vs true=[180, 180, 180]\nC. Varians & Ukuran Timpang (0.25 vs 2.4) |  2 | 0.2364 | pred=[237, 243] vs true=[120, 360]\nD. Non-Konveks (Dua Bulan Sabit)          |  2 | 0.4429 | pred=[170, 190] vs true=[180, 180]\n\n[Diagnosis Skenario C] Akibat bisektor Voronoi berada tepat di tengah dua centroid,\nsebanyak 123/360 (34.2%) anggota klaster lebar salah dicaplok ke klaster kecil!",
          "actualOutput": "=== Audit Kegagalan Geometri Asumsi Sferis / Voronoi pada K-Means++ ===\nSkenario Geometri                         |  K |  ARI   | Rasio Ukuran Prediksi vs Sejati\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nA. Isotropik Sferis (Ideal Voronoi)       |  3 | 1.0000 | pred=[180, 180, 180] vs true=[180, 180, 180]\nB. Anisotropik Memanjang (Elips Sejajar)  |  3 | 0.0632 | pred=[133, 174, 233] vs true=[180, 180, 180]\nC. Varians & Ukuran Timpang (0.25 vs 2.4) |  2 | 0.2364 | pred=[237, 243] vs true=[120, 360]\nD. Non-Konveks (Dua Bulan Sabit)          |  2 | 0.4429 | pred=[170, 190] vs true=[180, 180]\n\n[Diagnosis Skenario C] Akibat bisektor Voronoi berada tepat di tengah dua centroid,\nsebanyak 123/360 (34.2%) anggota klaster lebar salah dicaplok ke klaster kecil!",
