          "language": "python",
          "filename": "21_2_outlier_minibatch_gower_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import MiniBatchKMeans\n\n# 1) Audit Pengaruh Outlier (Influence Curve) vs Magnitudo Outlier: Mean (K-Means) vs Medoid (PAM)\nrng = np.random.default_rng(223)\nbase_1d = rng.normal(loc=10.0, scale=1.0, size=99)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Influence Curve: Pergeseran Pusat Klaster Saat 1 dari 100 Titik Jadi Outlier ===\")\nprint(\"Nilai 1 Outlier | Mean (K-Means) | Pergeseran Mean | Medoid L1 (PAM) | Pergeseran Medoid\")\nprint(\"-\" * 88)\nbase_mean = float(np.mean(base_1d))\nbase_med = float(base_1d[np.argmin(np.sum(np.abs(base_1d[:, None] - base_1d[None, :]), axis=1))])\nfor out_val in [15.0, 50.0, 200.0, 1000.0]:\n    arr = np.append(base_1d, out_val)\n    m_mean = float(np.mean(arr))\n    D1 = np.abs(arr[:, None] - arr[None, :])\n    m_med = float(arr[np.argmin(D1.sum(axis=1))])\n    print(f\"{out_val:15.1f} | {m_mean:14.4f} | {m_mean - base_mean:+15.4f} | {m_med:15.4f} | {m_med - base_med:+17.4f}\")\n\n# 2) Audit Jebakan `reassignment_ratio` pada MiniBatchKMeans Terhadap Segmen VIP Minoritas (1.7%)\nX_big1 = rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 0.9, size=(700, 2))\nX_big2 = rng.normal([6.5, 0.0], 0.9, size=(676, 2))\nX_vip = rng.normal([3.2, 11.5], 0.45, size=(24, 2))  # Segmen VIP sangat jelas tapi cuma 1.71% populasi!\nX_imb = np.vstack([X_big1, X_big2, X_vip])\nvip_slice = slice(1376, 1400)\n\nmb_default = MiniBatchKMeans(n_clusters=3, batch_size=128, init_size=1400, reassignment_ratio=0.05, n_init=3, random_state=42).fit(X_imb)\nmb_safe = MiniBatchKMeans(n_clusters=3, batch_size=512, init_size=1400, reassignment_ratio=0.0, n_init=3, random_state=42).fit(X_imb)\n\ndef vip_pure_cluster_preserved(labels: np.ndarray, vip_sl: slice) -> tuple[int, float]:\n    vip_lbls = labels[vip_sl]\n    dom = int(np.bincount(vip_lbls).argmax())\n    vip_in_dom = int(np.sum(vip_lbls == dom))\n    total_in_dom = int(np.sum(labels == dom))\n    precision_vip = vip_in_dom / max(total_in_dom, 1)\n    return total_in_dom, precision_vip\n\nsz_def, prec_def = vip_pure_cluster_preserved(mb_default.labels_, vip_slice)\nsz_saf, prec_saf = vip_pure_cluster_preserved(mb_safe.labels_, vip_slice)\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit MiniBatchKMeans `reassignment_ratio` pada Segmen VIP Minoritas (24/1400 = 1.71%) ===\")\nprint(f\"reassignment_ratio=0.05 (agresif) | Ukuran klaster VIP={sz_def:4d} | Kemurnian VIP={prec_def:.3f} <-- VIP terhapus/tercampur!\")\nprint(f\"reassignment_ratio=0.00 (aman)    | Ukuran klaster VIP={sz_saf:4d} | Kemurnian VIP={prec_saf:.3f} <-- Segmen VIP utuh 100%!\")\n\n# 3) Gower Distance + K-Medoids PAM untuk Data Pelanggan Campuran (Numerik + Kategorikal)\n#    Kolom: [pendapatan_juta, usia] + kategorikal [kota, tier_paket]\nn_g = 90\nnum_data = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([8.0, 25.0], [1.5, 2.5], size=(30, 2)),\n    rng.normal([25.0, 38.0], [3.0, 3.0], size=(30, 2)),\n    rng.normal([60.0, 50.0], [6.0, 4.0], size=(30, 2)),\n])\ncat_kota = np.array([\"Bandung\"] * 30 + [\"Jakarta\"] * 30 + [\"Surabaya\"] * 30)\ncat_tier = np.array([\"Starter\"] * 30 + [\"Growth\"] * 30 + [\"Enterprise\"] * 30)\n\n# Hitung matriks Gower Distance (rata-rata jarak ternormalisasi range numerik + mismatch kategorikal 0/1)\nranges = np.ptp(num_data, axis=0)\nd_num = np.sum(np.abs(num_data[:, None, :] - num_data[None, :, :]) / ranges[None, None, :], axis=2)\nd_cat = (cat_kota[:, None] != cat_kota[None, :]).astype(float) + (cat_tier[:, None] != cat_tier[None, :]).astype(float)\nD_gower = (d_num + d_cat) / 4.0\n\n# PAM 3-Medoids cepat atas matriks Gower\nmeds = [int(np.argmin(D_gower.sum(axis=1)))]\nbd = D_gower[:, meds[0]].copy()\nfor _ in range(2):\n    gains = np.maximum(bd[:, None] - D_gower, 0.0).sum(axis=0)\n    gains[meds] = -1.0\n    m_new = int(np.argmax(gains))\n    meds.append(m_new)\n    bd = np.minimum(bd, D_gower[:, m_new])\nmeds = sorted(meds)\nprint(\"\\n=== 3. Gower Distance + K-Medoids: Profil Medoid Merupakan Pelanggan Riil Valid ===\")\nfor cid, idx in enumerate(meds):\n    print(f\"  Medoid Klaster {cid} (ID #{idx:02d}): Pendapatan=Rp{num_data[idx,0]:4.1f}jt | Usia={num_data[idx,1]:4.1f}th | Kota={cat_kota[idx]:8s} | Tier={cat_tier[idx]}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Influence Curve: Pergeseran Pusat Klaster Saat 1 dari 100 Titik Jadi Outlier ===\nNilai 1 Outlier | Mean (K-Means) | Pergeseran Mean | Medoid L1 (PAM) | Pergeseran Medoid\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           15.0 |         9.8358 |         +0.0522 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n           50.0 |        10.1858 |         +0.4022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n          200.0 |        11.6858 |         +1.9022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n         1000.0 |        19.6858 |         +9.9022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n\n=== 2. Audit MiniBatchKMeans `reassignment_ratio` pada Segmen VIP Minoritas (24/1400 = 1.71%) ===\nreassignment_ratio=0.05 (agresif) | Ukuran klaster VIP= 608 | Kemurnian VIP=0.021 <-- VIP terhapus/tercampur!\nreassignment_ratio=0.00 (aman)    | Ukuran klaster VIP=  24 | Kemurnian VIP=1.000 <-- Segmen VIP utuh 100%!\n\n=== 3. Gower Distance + K-Medoids: Profil Medoid Merupakan Pelanggan Riil Valid ===\n  Medoid Klaster 0 (ID #24): Pendapatan=Rp 7.5jt | Usia=23.9th | Kota=Bandung  | Tier=Starter\n  Medoid Klaster 1 (ID #47): Pendapatan=Rp24.1jt | Usia=36.5th | Kota=Jakarta  | Tier=Growth\n  Medoid Klaster 2 (ID #64): Pendapatan=Rp59.1jt | Usia=52.1th | Kota=Surabaya | Tier=Enterprise",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Influence Curve: Pergeseran Pusat Klaster Saat 1 dari 100 Titik Jadi Outlier ===\nNilai 1 Outlier | Mean (K-Means) | Pergeseran Mean | Medoid L1 (PAM) | Pergeseran Medoid\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n           15.0 |         9.8358 |         +0.0522 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n           50.0 |        10.1858 |         +0.4022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n          200.0 |        11.6858 |         +1.9022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n         1000.0 |        19.6858 |         +9.9022 |          9.7553 |           +0.0000\n\n=== 2. Audit MiniBatchKMeans `reassignment_ratio` pada Segmen VIP Minoritas (24/1400 = 1.71%) ===\nreassignment_ratio=0.05 (agresif) | Ukuran klaster VIP= 608 | Kemurnian VIP=0.021 <-- VIP terhapus/tercampur!\nreassignment_ratio=0.00 (aman)    | Ukuran klaster VIP=  24 | Kemurnian VIP=1.000 <-- Segmen VIP utuh 100%!\n\n=== 3. Gower Distance + K-Medoids: Profil Medoid Merupakan Pelanggan Riil Valid ===\n  Medoid Klaster 0 (ID #24): Pendapatan=Rp 7.5jt | Usia=23.9th | Kota=Bandung  | Tier=Starter\n  Medoid Klaster 1 (ID #47): Pendapatan=Rp24.1jt | Usia=36.5th | Kota=Jakarta  | Tier=Growth\n  Medoid Klaster 2 (ID #64): Pendapatan=Rp59.1jt | Usia=52.1th | Kota=Surabaya | Tier=Enterprise",
          "explanation": "Memetakan kurva pergeseran pusat Mean vs Medoid saat 1 outlier naik dari 15 ke 1000, mendemonstrasikan penghapusan diam-diam segmen VIP 1.15% oleh reassignment_ratio agresif di MiniBatchKMeans, serta menguji Gower Distance + PAM pada data pelanggan campuran.",
