          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_circles, make_moons\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\n\ndef spectral_clustering_sym_scratch(X: np.ndarray, k: int, n_neighbors: int = 12, seed: int = 42):\n    \"\"\"Normalized Spectral Clustering (Ng, Jordan & Weiss 2002 / von Luxburg 2007) memakai L_sym.\"\"\"\n    n = X.shape[0]\n    # 1) Konstruksi Matriks Afinitas k-NN Simetris (W_ij = 1 jika i tetangga j ATAU j tetangga i)\n    d2 = np.sum((X[:, None, :] - X[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)\n    np.fill_diagonal(d2, np.inf)\n    knn_idx = np.argsort(d2, axis=1)[:, :n_neighbors]\n    A = np.zeros((n, n), dtype=float)\n    rows = np.repeat(np.arange(n), n_neighbors)\n    A[rows, knn_idx.ravel()] = 1.0\n    W = np.maximum(A, A.T)  # simetrisasi union k-NN\n\n    # 2) Matriks Derajat D dan Symmetric Normalized Laplacian L_sym = I - D^(-1/2) W D^(-1/2)\n    deg = W.sum(axis=1)\n    inv_sqrt_deg = np.where(deg > 0.0, 1.0 / np.sqrt(deg), 0.0)\n    L_sym = np.eye(n) - (inv_sqrt_deg[:, None] * W) * inv_sqrt_deg[None, :]\n    L_sym = 0.5 * (L_sym + L_sym.T)  # jamin simetri numerik eksak\n\n    # 3) Dekomposisi Eigen Simetris (ambil k eigenvector ber-eigenvalue terkecil)\n    eigvals, eigvecs = np.linalg.eigh(L_sym)\n    U = eigvecs[:, :k]\n\n    # 4) Langkah WAJIB Ng-Jordan-Weiss: normalisasi setiap baris U ke bola satuan L2!\n    row_norms = np.linalg.norm(U, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    T = U / np.maximum(row_norms, 1e-12)\n\n    # 5) Jalankan K-Means++ pada representasi spektral T\n    labels = KMeans(n_clusters=k, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10, random_state=seed).fit_predict(T)\n    return labels, eigvals[:6]\n\ndatasets = [\n    (\"Cincin Konsentris (make_circles)\", make_circles(n_samples=320, factor=0.45, noise=0.05, random_state=42), 2),\n    (\"Dua Bulan Sabit (make_moons)\", make_moons(n_samples=320, noise=0.06, random_state=42), 2),\n]\n\nprint(\"=== First-Principles Normalized Spectral Clustering (L_sym + Row Norm) vs K-Means ===\")\nfor name, (X_d, y_d), k in datasets:\n    lbl_km = KMeans(n_clusters=k, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(X_d)\n    lbl_sp, eigs6 = spectral_clustering_sym_scratch(X_d, k=k, n_neighbors=12, seed=42)\n    ari_km = adjusted_rand_score(y_d, lbl_km)\n    ari_sp = adjusted_rand_score(y_d, lbl_sp)\n    gap_k = float(eigs6[k] - eigs6[k - 1])\n    print(f\"\\nDataset: {name}\")\n    print(f\"  Top-6 Eigenvalues L_sym : {[round(float(e), 4) for e in eigs6]}  (Eigengap Delta_{k} = {gap_k:.4f})\")\n    print(f\"  ARI K-Means Mentah      = {ari_km:.4f}  <-- Gagal memotong struktur non-konveks!\")\n    print(f\"  ARI Spectral L_sym      = {ari_sp:.4f}  <-- Terpisah sempurna di ruang spektral!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== First-Principles Normalized Spectral Clustering (L_sym + Row Norm) vs K-Means ===\n\nDataset: Cincin Konsentris (make_circles)\n  Top-6 Eigenvalues L_sym : [-0.0, -0.0, 0.0119, 0.0128, 0.0129, 0.0144]  (Eigengap Delta_2 = 0.0119)\n  ARI K-Means Mentah      = -0.0022  <-- Gagal memotong struktur non-konveks!\n  ARI Spectral L_sym      = 1.0000  <-- Terpisah sempurna di ruang spektral!\n\nDataset: Dua Bulan Sabit (make_moons)\n  Top-6 Eigenvalues L_sym : [-0.0, 0.0006, 0.0034, 0.0048, 0.0148, 0.0179]  (Eigengap Delta_2 = 0.0028)\n  ARI K-Means Mentah      = 0.2476  <-- Gagal memotong struktur non-konveks!\n  ARI Spectral L_sym      = 1.0000  <-- Terpisah sempurna di ruang spektral!",
          "actualOutput": "=== First-Principles Normalized Spectral Clustering (L_sym + Row Norm) vs K-Means ===\n\nDataset: Cincin Konsentris (make_circles)\n  Top-6 Eigenvalues L_sym : [-0.0, -0.0, 0.0119, 0.0128, 0.0129, 0.0144]  (Eigengap Delta_2 = 0.0119)\n  ARI K-Means Mentah      = -0.0022  <-- Gagal memotong struktur non-konveks!\n  ARI Spectral L_sym      = 1.0000  <-- Terpisah sempurna di ruang spektral!\n\nDataset: Dua Bulan Sabit (make_moons)\n  Top-6 Eigenvalues L_sym : [-0.0, 0.0006, 0.0034, 0.0048, 0.0148, 0.0179]  (Eigengap Delta_2 = 0.0028)\n  ARI K-Means Mentah      = 0.2476  <-- Gagal memotong struktur non-konveks!\n  ARI Spectral L_sym      = 1.0000  <-- Terpisah sempurna di ruang spektral!",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan Normalized Spectral Clustering Ng-Jordan-Weiss (k-NN simetris -> L_sym -> eigh -> normalisasi baris L2 -> KMeans++) dari nol dan membuktikan ARI melonjak dari ~0.0-0.5 (K-Means) ke 1.000 pada cincin konsentris dan dua bulan sabit.",
