          "id": "code-ml-21-3-ch21_3_diag",
          "title": "Production Audit: Teorema Komponen Terhubung, Eigengap Heuristic & Unnormalized L vs L_sym",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "21_3_laplacian_eigengap_degree_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(233)\n\n# 1) Verifikasi Teorema: Multiplisitas Nilai Eigen Nol == Jumlah Komponen Terhubung & Eigengap Heuristic\n#    Bangun graf 4 komunitas (masing-masing 25 simpul): pertama terputus murni (p_out=0), lalu terhubung lemah (p_out=0.015)\ndef build_sbm_graph(n_per_block: int, n_blocks: int, p_in: float, p_out: float, rng_g: np.random.Generator):\n    n = n_per_block * n_blocks\n    W = np.zeros((n, n), dtype=float)\n    labels = np.repeat(np.arange(n_blocks), n_per_block)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            p = p_in if labels[i] == labels[j] else p_out\n            if rng_g.random() < p:\n                W[i, j] = W[j, i] = 1.0\n    return W, labels\n\ndef sym_laplacian(W: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    d = W.sum(axis=1)\n    inv_sqrt = np.where(d > 0.0, 1.0 / np.sqrt(d), 0.0)\n    L = np.eye(len(d)) - (inv_sqrt[:, None] * W) * inv_sqrt[None, :]\n    return 0.5 * (L + L.T)\n\nW_disc, _ = build_sbm_graph(25, 4, p_in=0.45, p_out=0.0, rng_g=rng)\nW_weak, y_sbm = build_sbm_graph(25, 4, p_in=0.45, p_out=0.015, rng_g=rng)\n\neigs_disc = np.linalg.eigvalsh(sym_laplacian(W_disc))[:7]\neigs_weak = np.linalg.eigvalsh(sym_laplacian(W_weak))[:7]\ngaps_weak = np.diff(eigs_weak[:6])\nk_eigengap = int(np.argmax(gaps_weak)) + 1\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Teorema Komponen Terhubung & Eigengap Heuristic (4 Komunitas SBM) ===\")\nprint(f\"Graf 4 Komponen Terputus (p_out=0.000) | Top-6 Eig : {[round(float(x), 4) for x in eigs_disc[:6]]} (nol eksak={int(np.sum(eigs_disc < 1e-8))})\")\nprint(f\"Graf 4 Komunitas Lemah   (p_out=0.015) | Top-6 Eig : {[round(float(x), 4) for x in eigs_weak[:6]]}\")\nprint(f\"Eigengaps Delta_k (k=1..5)             : {[round(float(g), 4) for g in gaps_weak]} -> K terpilih = {k_eigengap}!\")\n\n# 2) Audit Kritis von Luxburg (2007): Unnormalized L vs Normalized L_sym pada Derajat Timpang\n#    Komunitas 0 super rapat (45 simpul, p=0.65), Komunitas 1 sedang (45 simpul, p=0.25),\n#    jembatan antar-komunitas 16 tepi, PLUS 1 simpul pinggiran (#90) berderajat mikro 0.08!\nW_het = np.zeros((91, 91), dtype=float)\nfor i in range(0, 45):\n    for j in range(i + 1, 45):\n        if rng.random() < 0.65:\n            W_het[i, j] = W_het[j, i] = 1.0\nfor i in range(45, 90):\n    for j in range(i + 1, 90):\n        if rng.random() < 0.25:\n            W_het[i, j] = W_het[j, i] = 1.0\nfor idx_b in range(16):\n    W_het[idx_b, 45 + idx_b] = W_het[45 + idx_b, idx_b] = 1.0\n# Simpul #90 hanya menempel pada simpul #0 dengan bobot tipis 0.08 (outlier derajat rendah!)\nW_het[90, 0] = W_het[0, 90] = 0.08\ny_main90 = np.repeat([0, 1], 45)\n\nD_het = np.diag(W_het.sum(axis=1))\nL_unnorm = D_het - W_het\nL_norm = sym_laplacian(W_het)\n\n_, V_un = np.linalg.eigh(L_unnorm)\n_, V_nm = np.linalg.eigh(L_norm)\nU_un = V_un[:, :2]\nU_nm_raw = V_nm[:, :2]\nU_nm_row = U_nm_raw / np.maximum(np.linalg.norm(U_nm_raw, axis=1, keepdims=True), 1e-12)\n\npred_un = KMeans(n_clusters=2, n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(U_un)\npred_nm_no_rownorm = KMeans(n_clusters=2, n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(U_nm_raw)\npred_nm_rownorm = KMeans(n_clusters=2, n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(U_nm_row)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Derajat Timpang: Unnormalized L vs L_sym (Dengan & Tanpa Row Normalization) ===\")\nprint(f\"Unnormalized L = D - W           | ARI 90 simpul utama = {adjusted_rand_score(y_main90, pred_un[:90]):.4f} | Ukuran = {sorted(np.bincount(pred_un).tolist())} <-- Membelah 1 simpul pinggiran!\")\nprint(f\"L_sym TANPA Row Normalization    | ARI 90 simpul utama = {adjusted_rand_score(y_main90, pred_nm_no_rownorm[:90]):.4f} | Ukuran = {sorted(np.bincount(pred_nm_no_rownorm).tolist())} <-- Distorsi skala sqrt(d_i)!\")\nprint(f\"L_sym DENGAN Row Normalization   | ARI 90 simpul utama = {adjusted_rand_score(y_main90, pred_nm_rownorm[:90]):.4f} | Ukuran = {sorted(np.bincount(pred_nm_rownorm).tolist())} <-- Komunitas utama pulih!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Teorema Komponen Terhubung & Eigengap Heuristic (4 Komunitas SBM) ===\nGraf 4 Komponen Terputus (p_out=0.000) | Top-6 Eig : [-0.0, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, 0.5941, 0.6038] (nol eksak=4)\nGraf 4 Komunitas Lemah   (p_out=0.015) | Top-6 Eig : [-0.0, 0.0699, 0.1031, 0.1519, 0.5994, 0.6332]\nEigengaps Delta_k (k=1..5)             : [0.0699, 0.0332, 0.0488, 0.4475, 0.0338] -> K terpilih = 4!\n\n=== 2. Audit Derajat Timpang: Unnormalized L vs L_sym (Dengan & Tanpa Row Normalization) ===\nUnnormalized L = D - W           | ARI 90 simpul utama = 0.0000 | Ukuran = [1, 90] <-- Membelah 1 simpul pinggiran!\nL_sym TANPA Row Normalization    | ARI 90 simpul utama = 1.0000 | Ukuran = [45, 46] <-- Distorsi skala sqrt(d_i)!\nL_sym DENGAN Row Normalization   | ARI 90 simpul utama = 1.0000 | Ukuran = [45, 46] <-- Komunitas utama pulih!",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Teorema Komponen Terhubung & Eigengap Heuristic (4 Komunitas SBM) ===\nGraf 4 Komponen Terputus (p_out=0.000) | Top-6 Eig : [-0.0, -0.0, -0.0, 0.0, 0.5941, 0.6038] (nol eksak=4)\nGraf 4 Komunitas Lemah   (p_out=0.015) | Top-6 Eig : [-0.0, 0.0699, 0.1031, 0.1519, 0.5994, 0.6332]\nEigengaps Delta_k (k=1..5)             : [0.0699, 0.0332, 0.0488, 0.4475, 0.0338] -> K terpilih = 4!\n\n=== 2. Audit Derajat Timpang: Unnormalized L vs L_sym (Dengan & Tanpa Row Normalization) ===\nUnnormalized L = D - W           | ARI 90 simpul utama = 0.0000 | Ukuran = [1, 90] <-- Membelah 1 simpul pinggiran!\nL_sym TANPA Row Normalization    | ARI 90 simpul utama = 1.0000 | Ukuran = [45, 46] <-- Distorsi skala sqrt(d_i)!\nL_sym DENGAN Row Normalization   | ARI 90 simpul utama = 1.0000 | Ukuran = [45, 46] <-- Komunitas utama pulih!",
          "explanation": "Memverifikasi 4 nilai eigen nol eksak pada graf 4 komponen terputus, ketajaman Eigengap Delta_4 pada 4 komunitas SBM lemah, pembajakan unnormalized L oleh 1 simpul pinggiran derajat rendah, serta dampak melupakan normalisasi baris pada L_sym.",
