          "language": "python",
          "filename": "21_4_gap_statistic_and_ari_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import KMeans\n\ndef adjusted_rand_index_scratch(labels_a: np.ndarray, labels_b: np.ndarray) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Hitung Adjusted Rand Index (Hubert & Arabie 1985) dari nol lewat tabel kontingensi.\"\"\"\n    _, inv_a = np.unique(labels_a, return_inverse=True)\n    _, inv_b = np.unique(labels_b, return_inverse=True)\n    n = len(labels_a)\n    n_a, n_b = int(inv_a.max()) + 1, int(inv_b.max()) + 1\n    C = np.zeros((n_a, n_b), dtype=np.int64)\n    np.add.at(C, (inv_a, inv_b), 1)\n\n    comb2 = lambda x: x * (x - 1) / 2.0\n    sum_comb_c = float(np.sum(comb2(C)))\n    sum_comb_a = float(np.sum(comb2(C.sum(axis=1))))\n    sum_comb_b = float(np.sum(comb2(C.sum(axis=0))))\n    total_pairs = comb2(float(n))\n    expected = (sum_comb_a * sum_comb_b) / total_pairs\n    max_index = 0.5 * (sum_comb_a + sum_comb_b)\n    if abs(max_index - expected) < 1e-12:\n        return 1.0 if sum_comb_c == expected else 0.0\n    return (sum_comb_c - expected) / (max_index - expected)\n\ndef gap_statistic_pca_box(X: np.ndarray, k_max: int = 6, n_refs: int = 12, seed: int = 42):\n    \"\"\"Gap Statistic (Tibshirani, Walther & Hastie 2001) dengan referensi null PCA-aligned.\"\"\"\n    rng = np.random.default_rng(seed)\n    Xc = X - X.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n    _, _, Vt = np.linalg.svd(Xc, full_matrices=False)\n    Z = Xc @ Vt.T\n    z_min, z_max = Z.min(axis=0), Z.max(axis=0)\n\n    def fit_wcss(data: np.ndarray, k: int, s: int) -> float:\n        if k == 1:\n            return float(np.sum((data - data.mean(axis=0)) ** 2))\n        return float(KMeans(n_clusters=k, init=\"k-means++\", n_init=5, random_state=s).fit(data).inertia_)\n\n    wks, gaps, sks = [], [], []\n    for k in range(1, k_max + 1):\n        wk = fit_wcss(X, k, seed + k)\n        wks.append(wk)\n        log_wk = np.log(max(wk, 1e-12))\n        ref_logs = []\n        for b in range(n_refs):\n            Z_ref = rng.uniform(z_min, z_max, size=X.shape)\n            X_ref = Z_ref @ Vt + X.mean(axis=0, keepdims=True)\n            ref_logs.append(np.log(max(fit_wcss(X_ref, k, seed + 100 * b + k), 1e-12)))\n        ref_logs = np.array(ref_logs)\n        gaps.append(float(np.mean(ref_logs) - log_wk))\n        sks.append(float(np.std(ref_logs, ddof=1) * np.sqrt(1.0 + 1.0 / n_refs)))\n\n    # Aturan 1-SE Tibshirani: K terkecil di mana Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1) - s_{K+1}\n    k_opt = k_max\n    for idx in range(k_max - 1):\n        if gaps[idx] >= gaps[idx + 1] - sks[idx + 1]:\n            k_opt = idx + 1\n            break\n    return k_opt, wks, gaps, sks\n\nrng_d = np.random.default_rng(241)\n# Dataset A: 3 klaster sejati terpisah rapi\nX_3c = np.vstack([\n    rng_d.normal([-4.0, -2.5], 0.7, size=(90, 2)),\n    rng_d.normal([ 4.0, -2.0], 0.7, size=(90, 2)),\n    rng_d.normal([ 0.0,  4.2], 0.7, size=(90, 2)),\n])\n# Dataset B: Data Seragam Murni TANPA klaster sejati (K* = 1!)\nX_null = rng_d.uniform(-5.0, 5.0, size=(270, 2))\n\nfor title, X_cur in [(\"A. 3 Klaster Sejati (K*=3)\", X_3c), (\"B. Noise Seragam Tanpa Klaster (K*=1)\", X_null)]:\n    k_hat, wks, gaps, sks = gap_statistic_pca_box(X_cur, k_max=5, n_refs=12, seed=42)\n    print(f\"\\n=== Gap Statistic (PCA-Box, 1-SE Rule): {title} ===\")\n    print(\"  K |   WCSS (Elbow turun terus!) |  Gap(K) |   s_K  | Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1)-s_{K+1}?\")\n    for i in range(5):\n        if i < 4:\n            cond = gaps[i] >= gaps[i + 1] - sks[i + 1]\n            c_str = f\"{str(cond):5s} (rhs={gaps[i+1]-sks[i+1]:+.3f})\"\n        else:\n            c_str = \"batas akhir\"\n        print(f\"  {i+1} | {wks[i]:27.1f} | {gaps[i]:+7.4f} | {sks[i]:6.4f} | {c_str}\")\n    print(f\"  -> Keputusan Jujur Gap Statistic: K* = {k_hat}\")\n\n# Verifikasi cepat ARI dari nol (identik=1.0, permutasi label=1.0, acak~0.0)\na_ref = np.repeat([0, 1, 2], 40)\nb_perm = np.repeat([2, 0, 1], 40)\nb_rand = rng_d.integers(0, 3, size=120)\nprint(f\"\\n[Verifikasi ARI Scratch] Permutasi Sempurna={adjusted_rand_index_scratch(a_ref, b_perm):.4f} | Label Acak={adjusted_rand_index_scratch(a_ref, b_rand):+.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Gap Statistic (PCA-Box, 1-SE Rule): A. 3 Klaster Sejati (K*=3) ===\n  K |   WCSS (Elbow turun terus!) |  Gap(K) |   s_K  | Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1)-s_{K+1}?\n  1 |                      5525.7 | -0.1297 | 0.0328 | False (rhs=+0.086)\n  2 |                      2558.8 | +0.1215 | 0.0357 | False (rhs=+1.908)\n  3 |                       260.7 | +1.9576 | 0.0495 | True  (rhs=+1.625)\n  4 |                       222.7 | +1.6704 | 0.0449 | True  (rhs=+1.600)\n  5 |                       190.0 | +1.6289 | 0.0289 | batas akhir\n  -> Keputusan Jujur Gap Statistic: K* = 3\n\n=== Gap Statistic (PCA-Box, 1-SE Rule): B. Noise Seragam Tanpa Klaster (K*=1) ===\n  K |   WCSS (Elbow turun terus!) |  Gap(K) |   s_K  | Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1)-s_{K+1}?\n  1 |                      4484.1 | +0.4779 | 0.0330 | True  (rhs=+0.469)\n  2 |                      2602.5 | +0.5005 | 0.0313 | True  (rhs=+0.448)\n  3 |                      1673.4 | +0.4939 | 0.0461 | True  (rhs=+0.418)\n  4 |                      1108.5 | +0.4634 | 0.0450 | True  (rhs=+0.450)\n  5 |                       897.0 | +0.4770 | 0.0265 | batas akhir\n  -> Keputusan Jujur Gap Statistic: K* = 1\n\n[Verifikasi ARI Scratch] Permutasi Sempurna=1.0000 | Label Acak=-0.0062",
          "actualOutput": "=== Gap Statistic (PCA-Box, 1-SE Rule): A. 3 Klaster Sejati (K*=3) ===\n  K |   WCSS (Elbow turun terus!) |  Gap(K) |   s_K  | Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1)-s_{K+1}?\n  1 |                      5525.7 | -0.1297 | 0.0328 | False (rhs=+0.086)\n  2 |                      2558.8 | +0.1215 | 0.0357 | False (rhs=+1.908)\n  3 |                       260.7 | +1.9576 | 0.0495 | True  (rhs=+1.625)\n  4 |                       222.7 | +1.6704 | 0.0449 | True  (rhs=+1.600)\n  5 |                       190.0 | +1.6289 | 0.0289 | batas akhir\n  -> Keputusan Jujur Gap Statistic: K* = 3\n\n=== Gap Statistic (PCA-Box, 1-SE Rule): B. Noise Seragam Tanpa Klaster (K*=1) ===\n  K |   WCSS (Elbow turun terus!) |  Gap(K) |   s_K  | Gap(K) >= Gap(K+1)-s_{K+1}?\n  1 |                      4484.1 | +0.4779 | 0.0330 | True  (rhs=+0.469)\n  2 |                      2602.5 | +0.5005 | 0.0313 | True  (rhs=+0.448)\n  3 |                      1673.4 | +0.4939 | 0.0461 | True  (rhs=+0.418)\n  4 |                      1108.5 | +0.4634 | 0.0450 | True  (rhs=+0.450)\n  5 |                       897.0 | +0.4770 | 0.0265 | batas akhir\n  -> Keputusan Jujur Gap Statistic: K* = 1\n\n[Verifikasi ARI Scratch] Permutasi Sempurna=1.0000 | Label Acak=-0.0062",
          "explanation": "Mengimplementasikan Adjusted Rand Index (tabel kontingensi) dan Gap Statistic Tibshirani ber-referensi PCA-aligned dari nol, membuktikan keduanya memilih tepat K*=3 pada 3 klaster sejati dan secara jujur melaporkan K*=1 pada data seragam tanpa klaster.",
